          "description": "Come join the Odd Dog, Penguin Blue and Fred the Bear in this amazing audio collection of best-selling stories from from Rob Biddulph - the genius behind the #DrawWithRob phenomenon and the best-selling and award-winning Blown Away!\n\nEnjoy four hilarious and heartwarming stories from the best-selling and award-winning Rob Biddulph, featuring his most iconic and beloved characters, from Penguin Blue and the Odd Dog Out, to Fred the Bear and Wilbur the Seal.\n\nIncludes:\n\nBlown Away\nGRRRRR!\nOdd Dog Out\nSunk!",
